e not deducted, so the value can be somewhat high.","This is a model of your assumptions, not investment advice or a price target.","Credit spreads: ICE BofA US corporate option-adjusted spreads (FRED); synthetic rating from Damodaran’s interest-coverage table for large firms."],"sources":[{"label":"NVIDIA 10-K FY2026 (filed 2026-02-25)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000021/0001045810-26-000021-index.htm"},{"label":"Yahoo Finance share price","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/"},{"label":"FRED DGS10: 10-year US Treasury yield (2026-11-12)","url":"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/DGS10"},{"label":"U.S. Treasury daily par yield curve","url":"https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve"},{"label":"Damodaran Online (NYU Stern): implied ERP, country risk premiums, industry averages (US)","url":"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/New_Home_Page/datacurrent.html"},{"label":"SEC XBRL frames: Revenues and OperatingIncomeLoss, all filers","url":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/sec-api-documentation"},{"label":"ICE BofA US corporate option-adjusted spreads by rating (FRED)","url":"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/BAMLC0A4CBBB"}],"warnings":[],"inputs":{"growth_pct":30.0,"ebit_margin_pct":58.9736,"terminal_pct":3.0,"wacc_pct":12.9107,"rf_pct":5.1,"erp_pct":4.23,"value_per_share":85.4452,"price":162.85,"price_date":"2026-11-13","range_low":74.5896,"range_high":100.139,"model":{"base_revenue_m":215938.0,"growth_pct":[30.0,24.6,19.2,13.8,8.4],"ebit_margin_pct":58.97,"tax_pct":13.46,"da_pct":1.74,"capex_pct":2.34,"nwc_pct":25.0,"wacc_pct":12.9107,"terminal_pct":3.0,"debt_m":8468.0,"minority_m":0.0,"cash_m":10605.0,"shares_m":24100.0,"price":162.85,"first_year":"FY2027"}},"asof":"2026-11-15","disclaimer":"Educational analysis of reported SEC data and historical prices; not investment advice.","highlights":[{"label":"Model value per share","value":"$85.45","note":null,"tone":"d